 [17592186493330 1072 #uuid "8c698fb8-2f47-52aa-ab20-d02b17699d11" 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493330 1074 "Let $g(x)=4x+6$ and $f(g(x))=g(x{)}^{5}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & =({g}^{5}{)}^{′}=5{g}^{4}, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =(4x+6{)}^{′}=4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =5{g}^{4}\\cdot (4) \\\\  & =20(4x+6{)}^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493331 1068 #edb/ref 17592186493328 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493331 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493331 1071 "Given that $f(x)=\\sqrt{5x-3},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493331 1072 #uuid "97e8ab80-425a-5ce3-aeca-1b6c32080f6d" 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493331 1074 "Let $g(x)=5x-3$ and $f(g(x))=\\sqrt{g(x)}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & ={(\\sqrt{g})}^{′}=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{g}}, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =(5x-3)^{′}=5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{g}}\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{5x-3}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493332 1068 #edb/ref 17592186493333 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493332 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493332 1071 "Given that $f(x)={({x}^{5}-7{x}^{4})}^{2},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=2({x}^{5}-7{x}^{4})($\n{{field-1}}\n$)$" 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493332 1072 #uuid "a645231c-c79c-561b-9b41-b96c53332e19" 13194139535312 17592186045443 true] [17592186493332 1074 "Let $g(x)={x}^{5}-7{x}^{4}$ and $f(g(x))=g(x)^{2}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & =({g}^{2})^{′}=2g, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x)